Now, I haven't checked the source, but weap-343 says about damage
calculations;

  * If you scored a hit that exercises a weapon skill, the +DAM bonus for that
    weapon skill or for two-weapon combat skill (and for riding skill if
    applicable, unless using two weapons). If fighting with two weapons, your
    skill for this purpose is considered to be the lower of your actual  
    two-weapon skill and your skill in the single weapon scoring the hit.

That implies to me that you will wish to increase the skill in your
offhand weapon to maximise damage.
